#EXTM3U
# TIBI's built-in line-up. Every stream here is published free by the broadcaster itself, for anyone
# to watch on the web. Re-streams of paid channels do not belong here, whoever hosts them, and
# neither do FAST-platform relays (Xumo, Samsung TV Plus, Rakuten), which are licensed to those apps.
# Checked 2026-11-03 by playing each one in Edge through this player page (hls.js). Dropped then:
# NASA TV (403 - NASA moved to NASA+) and CGTN (its variant host sends no CORS header).
# HTTPS only: the player page is https, so an http stream would be blocked as mixed content.
#
# Philippines, checked 2026-11-03. Kept only where the stream is provably the broadcaster's own:
# CLTV 36 is served from cltv36.tv, and FilAmTV / Living Asia / Mindanow are the exact addresses
# VegasPlus (their network) embeds on vegasplus.us. Abante TV, Bilyonaryo, INC TV, SMNI and Hope
# Channel PH also play, but nothing on their own sites ties those addresses to them, so they are
# out until one does. GMA, ABS-CBN, TV5 and PTV publish no open stream (YouTube/Facebook/paid apps).
